luts.overview:
This landscape LUT is specifically designed for overcast and rainy conditions. By reshaping the green spectrum, it transforms hues into soft, deep, and vibrant tones reminiscent of moss saturated after rain—moist and serene. Its core features include: presenting a natural, sophisticated grey-green palette; reducing saturation and brightness to evoke the tranquil depths of a forest; Controlling overall contrast to preserve soft diffused light, with highlights veiled in mist and rich shadow detail;
Infusing scenes with a serene yet vibrant cinematic mood, perfectly capturing profound natural narratives.
Ideal for post-rain forests, misty mountain vistas, pastoral landscapes, and other scenes requiring a moist, tranquil atmosphere. We recommend slightly increasing exposure during pre-production to fully realise its soft, nuanced colour grading effects.
